From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: expose Sheng ABL splash as U-Boot video

Describe the 3048x2032 ARGB8888 panel in the 0xb8000000 splash allocation
for simplefb and EFI GOP. Retain Sheng's original splash node name while
testing the ABL display handoff; Asphalt's no-unit-address path is not yet
known to apply to Sheng.
The stride and format are initial ABL handoff candidates; validate their
physical output in a RAM boot before installing this firmware.

The splash address and extent come from the existing Sheng boot DT. The panel
geometry comes from the Sheng Linux panel modes. This is a local U-Boot-only
adaptation; it does not alter the imported Linux board patch or Linux DT.

Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
---
diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng-u-boot.dtsi b/arch/arm/dts/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng-u-boot.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f1956e7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng-u-boot.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+
+
+/* Candidate ABL framebuffer description; verify physical scanout. */
+/ {
+	chosen {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <2>;
+		ranges;
+
+		framebuffer@b8000000 {
+			compatible = "simple-framebuffer";
+			reg = <0 0xb8000000 0 0x2b00000>;
+			width = <3048>;
+			height = <2032>;
+			stride = <12192>;
+			format = "a8r8g8b8";
+		};
+	};
+};
